@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity
@using GestaoEventos.Models.Entities
@using GestaoEventos.Models.Constants
@inject SignInManager<Usuario> SignInManager

<ul class="navbar-nav">
    @if (SignInManager.IsSignedIn(User))
    {
        <li class="nav-item">
           @if (User.IsInRole(Perfis.Admin))
            {
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="Admin" asp-controller="Eventos" asp-action="Index">Eventos</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="Admin" asp-controller="Painel" asp-action="Index">Painel do Administrador</a>
                </li>
            }
            else
            {   
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="Participante" asp-controller="Painel" asp-action="Index">Meu painel</a>
                </li>
            }
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item">
            <span class="nav-link text-dark">Olá, @User.Identity?.Name</span>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
            <form asp-area="" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post" class="d-inline">
                <button type="submit" class="nav-link btn btn-link text-dark">Sair</button>
            </form>
        </li>
    }
    else
    {
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">Entrar</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register">Cadastrar</a>
        </li>
    }
</ul>